1. flips -- where the fixed-kx causal root flips, for single Lorentz gain lines pinned to eps(1) = 1 - i g.
   A record, not the reason for c: a finite beam does not see these flips (section 4), and how many
   a band holds depends on the grid (the finer grid below).
