    wc 0.9: 41.2462 deg (documented 41.246), |Re kz^2|/|Im kz^2| there 0.440
    wc 1.0: 41.8212 deg (documented 41.821), |Re kz^2|/|Im kz^2| there 0.008
    wc 1.1: 42.4828 deg (documented 42.483), |Re kz^2|/|Im kz^2| there 0.526
